    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Provides the ROBSE CTA dynamic block, an administrator-controlled standard menu profile for non-administrators, public custom post type menu choices, and a compact dashboard editing guide.</p>\n<h3>Uninstall</h3>\n<p>Deleting the plugin removes its CMS menu settings. Existing posts and pages are preserved.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload and activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>Use Settings &gt; ROBSE ONE CMS to configure the client menu profile.</li>\n<li>Insert ROBSE ONE sections from the block pattern library and the ROBSE CTA block from the inserter.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.2.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add CMS menu profile, public custom post type choices, and dashboard guide.</li>\n<li>Update the CTA block editor controls.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Independent Gutenberg CTA block and configurable client CMS menu profile for ROBSE ONE.",
    "description": "<p>Provides the ROBSE CTA dynamic block, an administrator-controlled standard menu profile for non-administrators, public custom post type menu choices, and a compact dashboard editing guide.</p>\n<h3>Uninstall</h3>\n<p>Deleting the plugin removes its CMS menu settings. Existing posts and pages are preserved.</p>\n",
